# __PACKAGE_NAME__

System2 provides a deliberate, spec-driven engineering workflow for Pi.

## Install

Install directly from GitHub:

```sh
pi install git:github.com/DeliberateCode/System2
```

Restart Pi or run `/reload`. No separate System2 configuration is required. Start work with:

```text
/system2 <your task>
```

Use `/system2-doctor` for a read-only summary of the current workflow state.

## Runtime boundary

System2 ships prompt templates and 13 role skills. Role switching happens in the current Pi session; System2 does not install an extension, hooks, or a permission layer. Pi's active tools, project trust, and user configuration remain authoritative.

## Update or remove

```sh
pi update git:github.com/DeliberateCode/System2
pi remove git:github.com/DeliberateCode/System2
```

